{
  "apiVersion": 1,
  "type": "docs.detail.section",
  "package": "@astryxdesign/cli",
  "data": {
    "id": "building-themes-for-production",
    "title": "Build a theme",
    "content": [
      {
        "type": "prose",
        "text": "`astryx theme build` compiles a defineTheme file into production-ready artifacts. Recommended for SSR apps (Next.js, Remix) where styles must be present on first paint."
      },
      {
        "type": "code",
        "lang": "bash",
        "code": "astryx theme build ./src/themes/ocean.ts",
        "label": "Build a theme"
      },
      {
        "type": "table",
        "headers": [
          "File",
          "Description"
        ],
        "rows": [
          [
            "ocean.css",
            "Pre-compiled CSS with token overrides, component overrides, and prose element styles in @scope rules"
          ],
          [
            "ocean.js",
            "ES module exporting the theme object with `__built: true` and pre-resolved token values."
          ],
          [
            "ocean.d.ts",
            "TypeScript declarations for the theme and icon registry exports"
          ],
          [
            "ocean.variants.d.ts",
            "(Optional) Module augmentations for custom component prop values"
          ]
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "prose",
        "text": "The `__built: true` flag tells Theme to skip runtime `<style>` injection; the CSS file handles it. Load the generated CSS wherever you load the module."
      },
      {
        "type": "code",
        "lang": "tsx",
        "code": "import {Theme} from '@astryxdesign/core/theme';\nimport {oceanTheme} from './themes/ocean';\nimport './themes/ocean.css';\n\n<Theme theme={oceanTheme}>\n  <App />\n</Theme>",
        "label": "Using a custom built theme"
      },
      {
        "type": "prose",
        "text": "After upgrading Astryx, rerun `astryx theme build` for every custom prebuilt theme. Deploy the regenerated files together. The runtime intentionally trusts `__built: true` and will not repair stale CSS from an older build. The build also warns when the theme names font families it does not load. See `astryx docs typography/font-setup` for the full recipe."
      },
      {
        "type": "prose",
        "text": "For the runtime vs built tradeoff, see the Runtime vs Built section of `astryx docs use-a-theme`."
      }
    ],
    "links": {
      "up": "astryx docs author-a-theme --index",
      "previous": "astryx docs author-a-theme adaptation-rules",
      "next": "astryx docs author-a-theme icon-registry"
    }
  },
  "meta": {
    "answeredBy": {
      "cli": "0.7.12",
      "core": "0.7.12",
      "copy": "starting"
    }
  }
}
